      "tool_count": 5,
      "tools": [
        {
          "name": "start_care_flow",
          "description": "启动一场作业流程会话（入住评估 → 日常服务 → 阶段复评 → 出院评估）。\n\n    对应 REST：POST /api/v1/care-flow/start\n\n    Args:\n        elder_id:        点位 ID\n        tenant_id:       租户 ID，必填且必须在 MCP_WRITE_TENANTS 白名单内\n        care_plan_id:    服务计划 ID（可选）\n        initial_stage:   起始阶段，默认 admission_assessment\n        discharge_order: 可选退住工单（入住时已知要出院可一并下发）\n\n    Returns:\n        {session_id, current_stage, ai_message}\n    ",
          "inputSchema": {
            "properties": {
              "elder_id": {
                "title": "Elder Id",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "tenant_id": {
                "title": "Tenant Id",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "care_plan_id": {
                "default": "",
                "title": "Care Plan Id",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "initial_stage": {
                "default": "admission_assessment",
                "title": "Initial Stage",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "discharge_order": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "type": "object"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
                "default": null,
                "title": "Discharge Order"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "elder_id",
              "tenant_id"
            ],
            "title": "start_care_flowArguments",
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "send_discharge_order",
          "description": "向进行中的作业流程会话下发退住工单（SaaS 主动通知）。\n\n    对应 REST：POST /api/v1/care-flow/sessions/{session_id}/discharge-order\n\n    只更新该会话检查点里的 state.discharge_order，**不推进对话**：作业人员下一次发言时，\n    check_stage_node 会识别工单并触发阶段收敛（当前阶段达 min 即并入 复评 → 出院评估）。\n\n    Args:\n        session_id: 作业流程会话 ID（由 start_care_flow 或 GET /active/{elder_id} 获得）\n        tenant_id:  租户 ID，必填且必须在白名单内\n        order:      退住工单 dict，如 {\"order_type\": \"discharge\", \"reason\": \"转院\"}\n\n    Returns:\n        {found, session_id, status, message}；found=False 表示会话不存在/跨租户/已结束。\n    ",
          "inputSchema": {
            "properties": {
              "session_id": {
                "title": "Session Id",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "tenant_id": {
                "title": "Tenant Id",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "order": {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "title": "Order",
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            "required": [
